Subject: [PATCH] Fix more issues with encodilng length

Should fix bug #77381, bug #77382, bug #77385, bug #77394.

5.4 backport: https://github.com/shivammathur/php-src-backports/commit/8960ff028003ee02239b9ba331a544fb023d43f6
